Yes you can use options.transformData.item like this:

```js
var hits = instantsearch.widgets.hits({
  transformData: {
    item: function(hit) {
      // change hit then
      // hit.show = true/false
      // return hit
    }
  }
});
```

Then in your template, just conditionally display the hit based on `show` value: http://stackoverflow.com/questions/6027525/how-do-i-accomplish-an-if-else-in-mustache-js
